{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awake in a mysterious facility and quickly realize something is wrong- you are not alone and everything is trying to kill you.\u00a0 </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through a large and mysterious facility. With dynamic level generation, no run will be the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock weapons, gear, attachments and experimental technology that will keep you alive and make you deadlier than ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drag and drop inventory management for modifying loadout and weapons on the run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modify and enhance your clone to survive longer and explore deeper each attempt to escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gunplay that will make you feel like a bad ass, even if you are in your underpants</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514440?t=1744330546","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/8be3ba6f3eca616c60753652a370e4ed63674839/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744330546","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/3a8e9c9f3f34b60b1d7dede957896a1bf6de7f71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744330546","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/3a8e9c9f3f34b60b1d7dede957896a1bf6de7f71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744330546","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"While the graphics of No Time For Pants are stylized and pixelated, the violence can depict heads exploding and lots of blood and dead bodies. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awake in a mysterious facility and quickly realize something is wrong- you are not alone and everything is tryi